function __rcReleaseTextZh(value){if(typeof value!=="string")return value;const map={"![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/8180fca8af2a3dd485321a4b2ffbcf08b4351060083a24309b72382035035638.png)":"![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/8180fca8af2a3dd485321a4b2ffbcf08b4351060083a24309b72382035035638.png)","We made several memory and performance improvements. Raycast's host process now uses about 50% less memory. Each extension process uses about 30% less memory at startup and less CPU when launching, which helps menu bar commands, background refreshes, and AI tools. We also fixed a memory leak that grew the longer Raycast stayed open. More details are below, and further improvements are coming in the next updates.":"我们对内存占用和性能进行了多项改进。Raycast 主进程的内存占用现已降低约 50%；每个扩展进程启动时的内存占用降低约 30%，启动时的 CPU 占用也有所减少，这有助于改善菜单栏命令、后台刷新和 AI 工具的表现。我们还修复了一个会随 Raycast 运行时间增长而加剧的内存泄漏问题。更多详情见下文，后续更新还将继续优化。","## 🤖 Auto Model":"## 🤖 自动模型","We reworked our Auto model, and you can now choose how it picks a model for you. It comes with three different preferences: Lightweight, Balanced, and Flagship. Balanced is the default and uses about 70% fewer credits than Flagship to help you get more out of your credits. Lightweight responds in about 70% less time than Flagship and works well for quick questions. Flagship uses the most capable models for harder tasks and requires a Pro+ or Max subscription.":"我们重新设计了自动模型，现在你可以选择它如何为你挑选模型。共有三种偏好：轻量、均衡和旗舰。默认的“均衡”模式比“旗舰”模式少消耗约 70% 的积分，让积分更耐用。“轻量”模式的响应耗时比“旗舰”模式缩短约 70%，适合快速问答。“旗舰”模式使用能力最强的模型处理复杂任务，需要 Pro+ 或 Max 订阅。","## ✨ New":"## ✨ 新功能","- **AI:** Added Claude and ChatGPT subscription usage in `/usage` in AI Chat and in Settings":"- **AI**：可在 AI 对话的 `/usage` 和设置中查看 Claude、ChatGPT 订阅用量。","- **AI:** Added Show AI Credits/Claude/ChatGPT Usage commands":"- **AI**：新增显示 AI 积分、Claude 和 ChatGPT 用量的命令。","- **Clipboard History**: Added a Paste as PNG action for TIFF images":"- **剪贴板历史**：为 TIFF 图像新增“粘贴为 PNG”操作。","- **Root Search**: Added direct search results for more settings, including Accessibility settings and Keyboard Shortcuts":"- **主搜索**：更多设置可直接出现在搜索结果中，包括辅助功能设置和键盘快捷键。","- **UI**: Added automatic color contrast adjustments throughout to ensure the UI remains legible":"- **界面**：新增自动颜色对比度调整，提高界面的可读性。","## 💎 Improvements":"## 💎 改进","- **AI Chat**: Mermaid diagrams now load only when a chat first needs them, which reduces memory usage":"- **AI 对话**：仅在对话首次需要时加载 Mermaid 图表功能，减少内存占用。","- **AI Permissions:** Extended Always Allow approvals to cover similar commands":"- **AI 权限**：“始终允许”的批准范围扩展至相似命令。","- **AI Permissions:** Reduced approval interruptions for routine Git and GitHub workflows, and improved Auto approval decisions":"- **AI 权限**：减少常规 Git 和 GitHub 工作流程中的批准提示，并改进自动批准判断。","- **Calendar**: Command icons now display the current date across Raycast":"- **日历**：Raycast 中的日历命令图标现在会显示当前日期。","- **Calendar**: Renamed the menu bar setting \"Only show events with meetings\" to \"Only show events with a conference link\", so it's clear why events without a video call link are hidden":"- **日历**：将菜单栏设置“仅显示有会议的日程”更名为“仅显示包含会议链接的日程”，明确说明没有视频通话链接的日程为何被隐藏。","- **Clipboard History**: Improved contrast of color swatch in color items":"- **剪贴板历史**：提高颜色条目中色块的对比度。","- **Eject All Disks**: Improved support for external drives and disk images, and added details about disks that could not be ejected":"- **推出所有磁盘**：改进对外部驱动器和磁盘映像的支持，并显示无法推出的磁盘详情。","- **Extensions**: Clarified how uninstalling an extension affects its settings and data across synced devices":"- **扩展**：更清楚地说明卸载扩展对各个同步设备上设置和数据的影响。","- **Extensions**: Improved performance when extensions refresh frequently in the background":"- **扩展**：改进扩展频繁后台刷新时的性能。","- **File Search**: The file indexer uses about 60% less memory when it updates its index":"- **文件搜索**：文件索引器更新索引时的内存占用降低约 60%。","- **General**: Improved reliability when your Mac wakes from sleep":"- **通用**：提高 Mac 从睡眠唤醒后的可靠性。","- **Memory Usage**: Reduced idle memory use and improved memory cleanup after closing Raycast windows by releasing retained graphics memory":"- **内存占用**：减少空闲时的内存使用，并在关闭 Raycast 窗口后释放保留的图形内存，改善内存清理。","- **Memory Usage**: Reduced memory overhead from command icons":"- **内存占用**：减少命令图标带来的内存开销。","- **Memory Usage**: Reduced extension worker memory by ~30% in idle workers":"- **内存占用**：空闲扩展工作进程的内存占用降低约 30%。","- **Memory Usage**: Reduced native host memory by 50%":"- **内存占用**：原生主进程的内存占用降低 50%。","- **Memory Usage**: Improved process memory diagnostic":"- **内存占用**：改进进程内存诊断。","- **Performance:** Reduced extensions worker startup CPU usage":"- **性能**：降低扩展工作进程启动时的 CPU 占用。","- **Performance:** Speed up command launches and prevent misinput while commands are loading":"- **性能**：加快命令启动，并防止加载命令时出现误输入。","- **Quick AI**: Added an option to hide the Quick AI hint in Root Search":"- **快捷 AI**：新增在主搜索中隐藏快捷 AI 提示的选项。","- **Root Search**: Recent searches keep their results, so typing them again responds faster":"- **主搜索**：保留最近搜索的结果，再次输入相同内容时响应更快。","- **Root Search**: Added support for numpad for number hotkeys":"- **主搜索**：数字快捷键支持数字小键盘。","## 🐞 Fixes":"## 🐞 修复","- **Action Panel:** Fixed loading spinner alignment in search menus":"- **操作面板**：修复搜索菜单中加载指示器的对齐问题。","- **AI**: Fixed new chats sometimes using the incorrect model when using the “Last Used Model” default setting":"- **AI**：修复默认设置为“上次使用的模型”时，新对话偶尔使用错误模型的问题。","- **AI:** Fixed an issue where Codex CLI wouldn’t be located properly after recent ChatGPT update":"- **AI**：修复最近 ChatGPT 更新后无法正确找到 Codex CLI 的问题。","- **AI Chat:** Fixed an issue where pinning a chat removed it from its project":"- **AI 对话**：修复置顶对话时将其移出所属项目的问题。","- **AI Chat:** Improved sidebar spacing and chat title fading":"- **AI 对话**：改进侧边栏间距和对话标题的渐隐效果。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed \"Open AI Settings\" opening an empty Settings window instead of the AI settings":"- **AI 对话**：修复“打开 AI 设置”打开空白设置窗口的问题。","- **Clipboard History**: Fixed missing text previews and link detection for URLs received through Universal Clipboard":"- **剪贴板历史**：修复通过通用剪贴板接收的网址缺少文字预览和链接识别的问题。","- **Commands**: Fixed losing keystrokes when typing immediately after launching a command with a hotkey":"- **命令**：修复通过快捷键启动命令后立即打字时丢失按键输入的问题。","- **Commands**: Fixed invisible Raycast windows blocking clicks in other apps after commands that did not open a window":"- **命令**：修复执行不打开窗口的命令后，不可见的 Raycast 窗口阻挡其他应用点击的问题。","- **Dictation**: Fixed function-key shortcuts failing when `Fn` was held to press the function key (`F1` , `F2`...)":"- **听写**：修复按住 `Fn` 使用功能键（`F1`、`F2` 等）时快捷键失效的问题。","- **Emoji Picker**: Ensured AI results are stable when pasting & keeping the window open":"- **表情选择器**：确保粘贴后保持窗口打开时，AI 结果保持稳定。","- **Extensions**: Fixed AppPicker width something blowing up":"- **扩展**：修复应用选择器宽度偶尔异常变大的问题。","- **Extensions**: Fixed colored tags/icons being illegible in some cases":"- **扩展**：修复彩色标签和图标在某些情况下难以辨认的问题。","- **File Search**: Fixed a memory leak when reading text from images":"- **文件搜索**：修复读取图像文字时的内存泄漏。","- File Search: Fixed recent files disappearing while the file index updates":"- **文件搜索**：修复文件索引更新期间最近文件消失的问题。","- **Keyboard**: Fixed a crash that could occur when changing keyboard input sources":"- **键盘**：修复切换键盘输入源时可能发生的崩溃。","- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed recorded shortcuts changing to modifier-only shortcuts when releasing the keys":"- **键盘快捷键**：修复录制快捷键后松开按键时，快捷键变成仅含修饰键的问题。","- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed double-tap shortcuts losing their left or right modifier selection when recorded":"- **键盘快捷键**：修复录制双击快捷键时丢失左侧或右侧修饰键选择的问题。","- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed hotkeys failing to trigger when assigned to left or right modifier keys, or when Caps Lock was enabled":"- **键盘快捷键**：修复绑定左右修饰键或开启 Caps Lock 时，快捷键无法触发的问题。","- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed modifier hotkeys unexpectedly stopping during a session":"- **键盘快捷键**：修复修饰键快捷键在使用过程中意外停止工作的问题。","- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed double-tap shortcuts triggering accidentally after clicks such as `⌘ + Click`":"- **键盘快捷键**：修复 `⌘ + 点击` 等操作后意外触发双击快捷键的问题。","- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed recording and triggering navigation-key shortcuts, including `Home`, `End`, `Page Up`, and `Page Down`, without an unwanted `Fn` modifier":"- **键盘快捷键**：修复 `Home`、`End`、`Page Up`、`Page Down` 等导航键快捷键的录制和触发，避免意外加入 `Fn` 修饰键。","- **Quicklinks**: Fixed issues where Quicklink icons would not reliably update or display":"- **快捷链接**：修复图标未能可靠更新或显示的问题。","- **Quicklinks**: Fixed a regression preventing from saving a Quicklink":"- **快捷链接**：修复无法保存快捷链接的回归问题。","- **Quicklinks**: Fixed flashing/jumping issues in search view when navigating entries":"- **快捷链接**：修复切换搜索条目时界面闪烁或跳动的问题。","- **Root Search**: Fixed `Tab` and alias navigation to focus the first empty command argument":"- **主搜索**：修复通过 `Tab` 和别名导航时未聚焦第一个空命令参数的问题。","- **Root Search**: Fixed running a command with missing required arguments in compact mode to expand the window and focus the missing argument":"- **主搜索**：在紧凑模式下运行缺少必填参数的命令时，正确展开窗口并聚焦缺失参数。","- **Script Commands**: Fixed fallback commands not receiving the search query as their first argument":"- **脚本命令**：修复备用命令未将搜索内容作为第一个参数接收的问题。","- **UI**: Ensured consistent window-blurred icon opacity between single/grouped buttons":"- **界面**：确保窗口失去焦点时，单个按钮与成组按钮的图标透明度一致。","- **Notes**: Fixed Copy Content from Search losing formatting when pasted into rich text editors":"- **笔记**：修复从搜索中复制内容后，粘贴到富文本编辑器时丢失格式的问题。","- **Notes**: Fixed line breaks being lost when pasting text":"- **笔记**：修复粘贴文本时丢失换行的问题。","- **Notes**: Fixed pasted Markdown being formatted inside code blocks instead of remaining plain text":"- **笔记**：修复粘贴到代码块中的 Markdown 被格式化，而未保持纯文本的问题。","- **Notes**: Fixed newly inserted dividers reverting to Markdown when pressing `Backspace`. The first press now selects the divider, and the second deletes it":"- **笔记**：修复按下 `Backspace` 时，新插入的分隔线变回 Markdown 的问题。现在第一次按下会选中分隔线，第二次按下才会删除。","![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/8180fca8af2a3dd485321a4b2ffbcf08b4351060083a24309b72382035035638.png)\n\n\nWe made several memory and performance improvements. Raycast's host process now uses about 50% less memory. Each extension process uses about 30% less memory at startup and less CPU when launching, which helps menu bar commands, background refreshes, and AI tools. We also fixed a memory leak that grew the longer Raycast stayed open. More details are below, and further improvements are coming in the next updates.\n\n\n## 🤖 Auto Model\n\n\nWe reworked our Auto model, and you can now choose how it picks a model for you. It comes with three different preferences: Lightweight, Balanced, and Flagship. Balanced is the default and uses about 70% fewer credits than Flagship to help you get more out of your credits. Lightweight responds in about 70% less time than Flagship and works well for quick questions. Flagship uses the most capable models for harder tasks and requires a Pro+ or Max subscription.\n\n\n## ✨ New\n\n- **AI:** Added Claude and ChatGPT subscription usage in `/usage` in AI Chat and in Settings\n- **AI:** Added Show AI Credits/Claude/ChatGPT Usage commands\n- **Clipboard History**: Added a Paste as PNG action for TIFF images\n- **Root Search**: Added direct search results for more settings, including Accessibility settings and Keyboard Shortcuts\n- **UI**: Added automatic color contrast adjustments throughout to ensure the UI remains legible\n\n## 💎 Improvements\n\n- **AI Chat**: Mermaid diagrams now load only when a chat first needs them, which reduces memory usage\n- **AI Permissions:** Extended Always Allow approvals to cover similar commands\n- **AI Permissions:** Reduced approval interruptions for routine Git and GitHub workflows, and improved Auto approval decisions\n- **Calendar**: Command icons now display the current date across Raycast\n- **Calendar**: Renamed the menu bar setting \"Only show events with meetings\" to \"Only show events with a conference link\", so it's clear why events without a video call link are hidden\n- **Clipboard History**: Improved contrast of color swatch in color items\n- **Eject All Disks**: Improved support for external drives and disk images, and added details about disks that could not be ejected\n- **Extensions**: Clarified how uninstalling an extension affects its settings and data across synced devices\n- **Extensions**: Improved performance when extensions refresh frequently in the background\n- **File Search**: The file indexer uses about 60% less memory when it updates its index\n- **General**: Improved reliability when your Mac wakes from sleep\n- **Memory Usage**: Reduced idle memory use and improved memory cleanup after closing Raycast windows by releasing retained graphics memory\n- **Memory Usage**: Reduced memory overhead from command icons\n- **Memory Usage**: Reduced extension worker memory by ~30% in idle workers\n- **Memory Usage**: Reduced native host memory by 50%\n- **Memory Usage**: Improved process memory diagnostic\n- **Performance:** Reduced extensions worker startup CPU usage\n- **Performance:** Speed up command launches and prevent misinput while commands are loading\n- **Quick AI**: Added an option to hide the Quick AI hint in Root Search\n- **Root Search**: Recent searches keep their results, so typing them again responds faster\n- **Root Search**: Added support for numpad for number hotkeys\n\n## 🐞 Fixes\n\n- **Action Panel:** Fixed loading spinner alignment in search menus\n- **AI**: Fixed new chats sometimes using the incorrect model when using the “Last Used Model” default setting\n- **AI:** Fixed an issue where Codex CLI wouldn’t be located properly after recent ChatGPT update\n- **AI Chat:** Fixed an issue where pinning a chat removed it from its project\n- **AI Chat:** Improved sidebar spacing and chat title fading\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed \"Open AI Settings\" opening an empty Settings window instead of the AI settings\n- **Clipboard History**: Fixed missing text previews and link detection for URLs received through Universal Clipboard\n- **Commands**: Fixed losing keystrokes when typing immediately after launching a command with a hotkey\n- **Commands**: Fixed invisible Raycast windows blocking clicks in other apps after commands that did not open a window\n- **Dictation**: Fixed function-key shortcuts failing when `Fn` was held to press the function key (`F1` , `F2`...)\n- **Emoji Picker**: Ensured AI results are stable when pasting & keeping the window open\n- **Extensions**: Fixed AppPicker width something blowing up\n- **Extensions**: Fixed colored tags/icons being illegible in some cases\n- **File Search**: Fixed a memory leak when reading text from images\n- File Search: Fixed recent files disappearing while the file index updates\n- **Keyboard**: Fixed a crash that could occur when changing keyboard input sources\n- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed recorded shortcuts changing to modifier-only shortcuts when releasing the keys\n- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed double-tap shortcuts losing their left or right modifier selection when recorded\n- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed hotkeys failing to trigger when assigned to left or right modifier keys, or when Caps Lock was enabled\n- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed modifier hotkeys unexpectedly stopping during a session\n- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed double-tap shortcuts triggering accidentally after clicks such as `⌘ + Click`\n- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Fixed recording and triggering navigation-key shortcuts, including `Home`, `End`, `Page Up`, and `Page Down`, without an unwanted `Fn` modifier\n- **Quicklinks**: Fixed issues where Quicklink icons would not reliably update or display\n- **Quicklinks**: Fixed a regression preventing from saving a Quicklink\n- **Quicklinks**: Fixed flashing/jumping issues in search view when navigating entries\n- **Root Search**: Fixed `Tab` and alias navigation to focus the first empty command argument\n- **Root Search**: Fixed running a command with missing required arguments in compact mode to expand the window and focus the missing argument\n- **Script Commands**: Fixed fallback commands not receiving the search query as their first argument\n- **UI**: Ensured consistent window-blurred icon opacity between single/grouped buttons\n- **Notes**: Fixed Copy Content from Search losing formatting when pasted into rich text editors\n- **Notes**: Fixed line breaks being lost when pasting text\n- **Notes**: Fixed pasted Markdown being formatted inside code blocks instead of remaining plain text\n- **Notes**: Fixed newly inserted dividers reverting to Markdown when pressing `Backspace`. The first press now selects the divider, and the second deletes it":"![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/8180fca8af2a3dd485321a4b2ffbcf08b4351060083a24309b72382035035638.png)\n\n我们对内存占用和性能进行了多项改进。Raycast 主进程的内存占用现已降低约 50%；每个扩展进程启动时的内存占用降低约 30%，启动时的 CPU 占用也有所减少，这有助于改善菜单栏命令、后台刷新和 AI 工具的表现。我们还修复了一个会随 Raycast 运行时间增长而加剧的内存泄漏问题。更多详情见下文，后续更新还将继续优化。\n\n## 🤖 自动模型\n\n我们重新设计了自动模型，现在你可以选择它如何为你挑选模型。共有三种偏好：轻量、均衡和旗舰。默认的“均衡”模式比“旗舰”模式少消耗约 70% 的积分，让积分更耐用。“轻量”模式的响应耗时比“旗舰”模式缩短约 70%，适合快速问答。“旗舰”模式使用能力最强的模型处理复杂任务，需要 Pro+ 或 Max 订阅。\n\n## ✨ 新功能\n\n- **AI**：可在 AI 对话的 `/usage` 和设置中查看 Claude、ChatGPT 订阅用量。\n- **AI**：新增显示 AI 积分、Claude 和 ChatGPT 用量的命令。\n- **剪贴板历史**：为 TIFF 图像新增“粘贴为 PNG”操作。\n- **主搜索**：更多设置可直接出现在搜索结果中，包括辅助功能设置和键盘快捷键。\n- **界面**：新增自动颜色对比度调整，提高界面的可读性。\n\n## 💎 改进\n\n- **AI 对话**：仅在对话首次需要时加载 Mermaid 图表功能，减少内存占用。\n- **AI 权限**：“始终允许”的批准范围扩展至相似命令。\n- **AI 权限**：减少常规 Git 和 GitHub 工作流程中的批准提示，并改进自动批准判断。\n- **日历**：Raycast 中的日历命令图标现在会显示当前日期。\n- **日历**：将菜单栏设置“仅显示有会议的日程”更名为“仅显示包含会议链接的日程”，明确说明没有视频通话链接的日程为何被隐藏。\n- **剪贴板历史**：提高颜色条目中色块的对比度。\n- **推出所有磁盘**：改进对外部驱动器和磁盘映像的支持，并显示无法推出的磁盘详情。\n- **扩展**：更清楚地说明卸载扩展对各个同步设备上设置和数据的影响。\n- **扩展**：改进扩展频繁后台刷新时的性能。\n- **文件搜索**：文件索引器更新索引时的内存占用降低约 60%。\n- **通用**：提高 Mac 从睡眠唤醒后的可靠性。\n- **内存占用**：减少空闲时的内存使用，并在关闭 Raycast 窗口后释放保留的图形内存，改善内存清理。\n- **内存占用**：减少命令图标带来的内存开销。\n- **内存占用**：空闲扩展工作进程的内存占用降低约 30%。\n- **内存占用**：原生主进程的内存占用降低 50%。\n- **内存占用**：改进进程内存诊断。\n- **性能**：降低扩展工作进程启动时的 CPU 占用。\n- **性能**：加快命令启动，并防止加载命令时出现误输入。\n- **快捷 AI**：新增在主搜索中隐藏快捷 AI 提示的选项。\n- **主搜索**：保留最近搜索的结果，再次输入相同内容时响应更快。\n- **主搜索**：数字快捷键支持数字小键盘。\n\n## 🐞 修复\n\n- **操作面板**：修复搜索菜单中加载指示器的对齐问题。\n- **AI**：修复默认设置为“上次使用的模型”时，新对话偶尔使用错误模型的问题。\n- **AI**：修复最近 ChatGPT 更新后无法正确找到 Codex CLI 的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复置顶对话时将其移出所属项目的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：改进侧边栏间距和对话标题的渐隐效果。\n- **AI 对话**：修复“打开 AI 设置”打开空白设置窗口的问题。\n- **剪贴板历史**：修复通过通用剪贴板接收的网址缺少文字预览和链接识别的问题。\n- **命令**：修复通过快捷键启动命令后立即打字时丢失按键输入的问题。\n- **命令**：修复执行不打开窗口的命令后，不可见的 Raycast 窗口阻挡其他应用点击的问题。\n- **听写**：修复按住 `Fn` 使用功能键（`F1`、`F2` 等）时快捷键失效的问题。\n- **表情选择器**：确保粘贴后保持窗口打开时，AI 结果保持稳定。\n- **扩展**：修复应用选择器宽度偶尔异常变大的问题。\n- **扩展**：修复彩色标签和图标在某些情况下难以辨认的问题。\n- **文件搜索**：修复读取图像文字时的内存泄漏。\n- **文件搜索**：修复文件索引更新期间最近文件消失的问题。\n- **键盘**：修复切换键盘输入源时可能发生的崩溃。\n- **键盘快捷键**：修复录制快捷键后松开按键时，快捷键变成仅含修饰键的问题。\n- **键盘快捷键**：修复录制双击快捷键时丢失左侧或右侧修饰键选择的问题。\n- **键盘快捷键**：修复绑定左右修饰键或开启 Caps Lock 时，快捷键无法触发的问题。\n- **键盘快捷键**：修复修饰键快捷键在使用过程中意外停止工作的问题。\n- **键盘快捷键**：修复 `⌘ + 点击` 等操作后意外触发双击快捷键的问题。\n- **键盘快捷键**：修复 `Home`、`End`、`Page Up`、`Page Down` 等导航键快捷键的录制和触发，避免意外加入 `Fn` 修饰键。\n- **快捷链接**：修复图标未能可靠更新或显示的问题。\n- **快捷链接**：修复无法保存快捷链接的回归问题。\n- **快捷链接**：修复切换搜索条目时界面闪烁或跳动的问题。\n- **主搜索**：修复通过 `Tab` 和别名导航时未聚焦第一个空命令参数的问题。\n- **主搜索**：在紧凑模式下运行缺少必填参数的命令时，正确展开窗口并聚焦缺失参数。\n- **脚本命令**：修复备用命令未将搜索内容作为第一个参数接收的问题。\n- **界面**：确保窗口失去焦点时，单个按钮与成组按钮的图标透明度一致。\n- **笔记**：修复从搜索中复制内容后，粘贴到富文本编辑器时丢失格式的问题。\n- **笔记**：修复粘贴文本时丢失换行的问题。\n- **笔记**：修复粘贴到代码块中的 Markdown 被格式化，而未保持纯文本的问题。\n- **笔记**：修复按下 `Backspace` 时，新插入的分隔线变回 Markdown 的问题。现在第一次按下会选中分隔线，第二次按下才会删除。","🎛️ Performance Improvements and Auto Model":"🎛️ 性能改进与自动模型","🔌 External Model Providers":"🔌 外部模型服务商","🌉 macOS Golden Gate Ready":"🌉 适配 macOS Golden Gate","✨ New In Raycast AI":"✨ Raycast AI 新功能","🦙 Bring Your Own Model":"🦙 接入自有模型","😁 Inline Emoji Picker":"😁 输入时选择表情","🎉Raycast 2.0 is out of Beta!":"🎉 Raycast 2.0 正式发布！","💻 Screen Awareness":"💻 屏幕感知","🔔 AI Chat Notifications":"🔔 AI 对话通知","☁️ Cloud Sync":"☁️ 云同步","✍️ Edit AI chat messages":"✍️ 编辑 AI 对话消息","📄 Content Indexing":"📄 内容索引","📏 Interface Size":"📏 界面大小","✍️ Inline Replace for AI and Translate":"✍️ AI 与翻译的原位替换","🎯 Raycast Focus":"🎯 Raycast 专注","🤖  Shared AI Commands, Agents and Dictation Styles":"🤖 共享 AI 命令、智能体和听写风格","🎨 Color Conversion":"🎨 颜色转换","✍️ Quick Fix":"✍️ 快速修正","🚀 Public Beta":"🚀 公开测试版","🔍 Settings Search":"🔍 设置搜索","![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/bbfd0269e25f7a8909adb58e809fc732e977d0a75c6a467681fbd18bcf1a1621.png)":"![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/bbfd0269e25f7a8909adb58e809fc732e977d0a75c6a467681fbd18bcf1a1621.png)","We made more memory and performance improvements. AI Chat, Notes and Settings now each run in their own process, so a busy chat or a heavy note no longer slows down Root Search, and closing them frees up their memory. The launcher can use up to 35% less memory while idle. File Search uses up to 80% less memory at peak and up to 95% less while searching, searches are up to 30% faster, and background indexing uses much less CPU. More details are below.":"我们进一步优化了内存占用与性能。AI 对话、笔记和设置现在各自在独立进程中运行，繁忙的对话或复杂的笔记不再拖慢主搜索，关闭后也会释放内存。启动器空闲时的内存占用最多降低 35%。文件搜索的峰值内存占用最多降低 80%，搜索期间最多降低 95%，搜索速度最多提升 30%，后台索引的 CPU 占用也显著减少。更多详情见下文。","## 💬 Send Context to AI":"## 💬 向 AI 发送上下文","Two new commands let you show AI exactly what you're looking at. **Send Element to AI** lets you hover over anything on your screen, like a paragraph, an image or a button, and click to send it to AI Chat. To share a whole window instead, use **Send Window to AI**.":"两个新命令让你可以将正在查看的内容直接交给 AI。**将元素发送到 AI**：将指针移到屏幕上的段落、图片或按钮等元素上，点击即可发送到 AI 对话。若要分享整个窗口，请使用**将窗口发送到 AI**。","**Tip:** Assign a hotkey like `⌘ + ⇧ + 0` to Send Element to AI to grab context even faster.":"**提示：**为“将元素发送到 AI”设置快捷键，例如 `⌘ + ⇧ + 0`，便能更快地获取上下文。","- **Custom AI Providers**: You can now give custom provider models Raycast's Web Search, Read Page, Search Images and Chart tools. [Turn them on](https://manual.raycast.com/ai/custom-providers#tools) with a `tools` block in `providers.yaml`, and choose whether each one runs on Raycast, your company gateway, or a vendor you have a key for (Tavily, Exa, Firecrawl, Brave, Perplexity or Jina)":"- **自定义 AI 模型服务商**：现在可为自定义模型服务商的模型启用 Raycast 的网页搜索、读取网页、搜索图片和图表工具。在 `providers.yaml` 中添加 `tools` 配置块即可[启用这些工具](https://manual.raycast.com/ai/custom-providers#tools)，并可为每个工具选择使用 Raycast、公司网关，或你拥有密钥的服务商（Tavily、Exa、Firecrawl、Brave、Perplexity 或 Jina）。","- **Script Commands**: Added controls to enable or disable background refresh for individual scripts":"- **脚本命令**：新增单独启用或禁用各脚本后台刷新的控制选项。","- **AI**: Made AI requests smaller, so local models reply to a simple message much faster than before and simple requests use fewer credits, without sacrificing response quality. Initial context is now 15% smaller for normal queries, and 40% smaller with automatic extension and skill discovery turned off":"- **AI**：缩小了 AI 请求，在保持回复质量的同时，让本地模型更快地回复简单消息，并减少简单请求消耗的积分。常规查询的初始上下文缩小了 15%；关闭自动发现扩展和技能后，缩小了 40%。","- **AI:** Improved Quick Fix performance":"- **AI**：提升了快速修正的性能。","- **AI Skills**: Improved error details to help AI recover when a skill cannot be loaded":"- **AI 技能**：完善了错误详情，帮助 AI 在无法加载技能时恢复。","- **AI Chat**: Included archived chats in sidebar search results":"- **AI 对话**：侧边栏搜索结果现在包含已归档的对话。","- **AI Chat**: The extensions list in chat settings now shows every extension whose tools the chat uses, including Terminal, Finder and Automations":"- **AI 对话**：对话设置中的扩展列表现在会显示对话所用工具对应的全部扩展，包括终端、访达和自动化。","- **AI Commands**: AI Commands and automations no longer stop to show a question form. They now include any question in their reply instead":"- **AI 命令**：AI 命令和自动化不再暂停并显示提问表单，需要询问的问题会直接包含在回复中。","- **AI Commands**: When **Replace Selection** can't paste the response, the response is kept on your clipboard and in Clipboard History, and a warning tells you it was copied. This also applies to **Translator**":"- **AI 命令**：当**替换所选内容**无法粘贴回复时，回复会保留在剪贴板和剪贴板历史中，并显示警告，告知回复已复制。此改进同样适用于**翻译器**。","- **Dictation:** We now show a clearer status when wrapping up sessions and confirm with a success HUD when finishing a session":"- **听写**：结束会话时的状态提示更清晰，完成后会显示成功提示。","- **Dictation:** We improved post-processing to be faster and more reliable":"- **听写**：后处理速度更快，也更可靠。","- **Clipboard History**: Added an option to save Universal Clipboard items from your iPhone or iPad as soon as they arrive. Find it under Clipboard History settings":"- **剪贴板历史**：新增选项，可在收到 iPhone 或 iPad 的通用剪贴板内容后立即保存，可在剪贴板历史设置中开启。","- **Extensions**: Added support for pasting files copied from Finder or File Explorer directly into file pickers":"- **扩展**：支持将从访达或文件资源管理器复制的文件直接粘贴到文件选择器中。","- **File Search**: Improved CPU and memory utilization. It now uses up to 80% less memory at peak and up to 95% less while searching. Searches are also up to 30% faster, depending on the search terms and number of documents":"- **文件搜索**：优化了 CPU 和内存使用。峰值内存占用最多降低 80%，搜索期间最多降低 95%；根据搜索词和文档数量的不同，搜索速度最多提升 30%。","- **File Search**: Common development environment caches (e.g. `.cargo/global-cache`, `.venv`) are now excluded from indexing":"- **文件搜索**：索引现在会排除常见的开发环境缓存，例如 `.cargo/global-cache` 和 `.venv`。","- **File Search:** Added image dimensions to the details panel":"- **文件搜索**：详情面板新增图片尺寸信息。","- **Memory & Performance:** AI Chat, Notes and Settings now each run in their own process, separate from the launcher. A busy AI Chat or a heavy note no longer slows down Root Search, closed windows free their memory after a cooldown period so Raycast uses less while idle, and it's easier to see which part of Raycast is using memory or CPU":"- **内存与性能**：AI 对话、笔记和设置现在各自在独立于启动器的进程中运行。繁忙的 AI 对话或复杂笔记不再拖慢主搜索；关闭窗口后，经过短暂等待便会释放其内存，降低 Raycast 空闲时的占用；也更容易辨认各部分的内存和 CPU 使用情况。","- **Navigation**: Added support for `Page Up` and `Page Down` in lists and grids":"- **导航**：列表和网格支持使用 `Page Up` 和 `Page Down` 翻页。","- **Root Search**: Improved ranking to favor complete words and exact title matches while preserving results learned from your previous searches":"- **主搜索**：优化排序，优先匹配完整单词和精确标题，同时保留从以往搜索中学习到的结果偏好。","- **Root Search**: Prioritized applications when results are otherwise equally relevant":"- **主搜索**：当结果的相关性相同时，优先显示应用。","- **Settings:** AI Model provider sections in the Manage Models settings page now persist their collapsed state":"- **设置**：“管理模型”页面现在会记住各 AI 模型服务商分区的折叠状态。","- **Settings**: Opening a setting or command from elsewhere in Raycast now reliably scrolls to it and highlights it, including when you switch settings pages or select the same item again":"- **设置**：从 Raycast 其他位置打开设置项或命令时，现在能可靠地滚动到对应位置并高亮显示，包括切换设置页面或再次选择同一项的情况。","- **Startup**: Raycast now waits for the keychain to become available instead of showing \"Failed to start\". If it waits more than 10 seconds, it tells you what it's waiting for":"- **启动**：Raycast 现在会等待钥匙串可用，不再直接显示“启动失败”。若等待超过 10 秒，会说明正在等待什么。","- **Action Panel**: Fixed the action panel sometimes staying stuck open":"- **操作面板**：修复操作面板有时卡在打开状态的问题。","- **AI Chat:** Fixed Quick Look when viewing attachments displaying an icon mid-transition":"- **AI 对话**：修复使用快速查看浏览附件时，过渡动画中途显示图标的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Long chat titles and the model and reasoning effort labels truncate in the header":"- **AI 对话**：标题栏中过长的对话标题、模型名称和推理强度标签现在会截断显示。","- **AI Chat**: Long model names in the `/` menu truncates, and hovering a model now shows a preview of its details":"- **AI 对话**：`/` 菜单中过长的模型名称现在会截断显示，悬停在模型上可预览其详情。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed chats created before 2.3.0 reopening with no agent and the default model. They now restore their original agent, model and reasoning effort":"- **AI 对话**：修复 2.3.0 之前创建的对话重新打开后丢失智能体并使用默认模型的问题，现在会恢复原来的智能体、模型和推理强度。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed Reasoning Effort being hidden for agents whose model is set to Inherit":"- **AI 对话**：修复模型设为“继承”的智能体不显示推理强度的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed `⌘ + Enter` and `⌥ + Enter` not working while the tool-approval input is focused":"- **AI 对话**：修复工具批准输入框获得焦点时，`⌘ + Enter` 和 `⌥ + Enter` 无效的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed chats that AI had archived, pinned or deleted not updating in the sidebar until Raycast was restarted":"- **AI 对话**：修复 AI 归档、置顶或删除对话后，侧边栏必须重新启动 Raycast 才更新的问题。","- **Auto Quit**: Fixed apps like Slack being quit during calls on macOS 27":"- **自动退出**：修复 macOS 27 上 Slack 等应用在通话期间被退出的问题。","- **Clipboard History**: Fixed clipboard capture getting stuck when an app stopped responding while its copied content was being read":"- **剪贴板历史**：修复读取复制内容时，来源应用停止响应导致剪贴板捕获卡住的问题。","- **Dictation**: Fixed an issue where dictation would continue when you locked your machine or put it to sleep":"- **听写**：修复锁定电脑或使其进入睡眠后，听写仍继续运行的问题。","- **Dictionary**: Allowed text selection in the detail view":"- **词典**：详情视图中的文本现在可以选中。","- **Extensions**: Fixed manually running a command re-enabling background refresh after it had been disabled":"- **扩展**：修复禁用后台刷新后，手动运行命令会再次启用后台刷新的问题。","- **Extensions**: Allowed text selection in list detail panels":"- **扩展**：列表详情面板中的文本现在可以选中。","- **Feedback**: Allowed Escape to close the window, respecting the user preference":"- **反馈**：支持按 Escape 关闭窗口，并遵循用户的偏好设置。","- **File Search**: Brought back the Raycast v1 shortcut `⌘ + I` for **Show Info in Finder**":"- **文件搜索**：恢复 Raycast v1 中用于**在访达中显示简介**的快捷键 `⌘ + I`。","- **File Search:** Content search using Spotlight should now be faster and return the intended results":"- **文件搜索**：使用 Spotlight 搜索文件内容时，现在速度更快，结果也更符合预期。","- **Focus**: Fixed apps blocked by a Focus session reopening before you acknowledged that the session ended. They're now restored when you dismiss the completion prompt, even after a restart":"- **专注**：修复专注会话结束后，尚未确认结束便重新打开被阻止应用的问题。现在仅在关闭完成提示后恢复这些应用，重新启动后也一样。","- **Hotkeys**: Fixed text typed right after opening Raycast with a hotkey being swallowed for a few seconds and then lost":"- **快捷键**：修复通过快捷键打开 Raycast 后立即输入的文字被吞掉数秒，随后丢失的问题。","- **Hotkey Recorder**: Fixed flickering when deleting a hotkey with Backspace":"- **快捷键录入**：修复使用 Backspace 删除快捷键时的闪烁问题。","- **Launcher**: Fixed the global hotkey reopening the last command instead of Root Search, and the window not closing or returning to root after a command was opened by hotkey during startup":"- **启动器**：修复全局快捷键重新打开上一个命令而非主搜索的问题，以及启动期间通过快捷键打开命令后，窗口无法关闭或返回主搜索的问题。","- **Notes**: Improved performance when opening notes with deeply nested lists":"- **笔记**：提升打开包含深层嵌套列表的笔记时的性能。","- **Notes**: Made sure notes you create now keep working after future updates":"- **笔记**：确保现在创建的笔记在未来更新后仍能正常使用。","- **Notes**: Fixed code blocks being dropped when AI created or edited a note":"- **笔记**：修复 AI 创建或编辑笔记时丢失代码块的问题。","- **Notes**: Fixed note titles of AI created notes not updating after first line edit":"- **笔记**：修复编辑首行后，AI 创建的笔记标题未更新的问题。","- **MCP**: Fixed edits to running servers reverting to their previous configuration":"- **MCP**：修复对正在运行的服务器所作的修改被还原为旧配置的问题。","- **Memory Usage:** Fixed various memory leaks that could contribute to RAM usage growing":"- **内存使用**：修复多处可能导致内存占用持续增长的内存泄漏。","- **Open Camera**: Fixed the camera preview closing when Raycast loses focus, for example while changing Video Effects in Control Center. It now stays on screen until you close it":"- **打开相机**：修复 Raycast 失去焦点时相机预览关闭的问题，例如在控制中心调整视频效果时。预览现在会一直保留在屏幕上，直到你手动关闭。","- **Quick AI**: Fixed new chats using the default model from the model list instead of the **Quick AI** default model set in Settings":"- **快捷 AI**：修复新对话使用模型列表的默认模型，而非设置中为**快捷 AI**指定的默认模型的问题。","- **Quicklinks**: Preserved favicons when “Open With” is a browser":"- **快捷链接**：“打开方式”设为浏览器时，现在会保留网站图标。","- **Root Search**: Localized application names should now correctly be searchable":"- **主搜索**：现在可以正确搜索应用的本地化名称。","- **Root Search**: Prevented Quicklink arguments retaining focus after execution":"- **主搜索**：避免快捷链接执行后参数输入框仍保留焦点。","- **Settings**: Fixed the selection highlight being too faint for disabled commands":"- **设置**：修复已禁用命令的选中高亮过浅的问题。","- **Settings**: Fixed a crash when changing the interface size while the main window was hidden":"- **设置**：修复主窗口隐藏时更改界面尺寸导致崩溃的问题。","- **Settings**: Fixed command rows expanding and highlighting again after you'd already navigated to them":"- **设置**：修复已定位到命令后，对应行再次展开并高亮的问题。","- **Updater:** Fixed an issue where querying the updater's Login Items status could freeze Raycast.":"- **更新程序**：修复查询更新程序的登录项状态可能导致 Raycast 卡死的问题。","![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/bbfd0269e25f7a8909adb58e809fc732e977d0a75c6a467681fbd18bcf1a1621.png)\n\n\nWe made more memory and performance improvements. AI Chat, Notes and Settings now each run in their own process, so a busy chat or a heavy note no longer slows down Root Search, and closing them frees up their memory. The launcher can use up to 35% less memory while idle. File Search uses up to 80% less memory at peak and up to 95% less while searching, searches are up to 30% faster, and background indexing uses much less CPU. More details are below.\n\n\n## 💬 Send Context to AI\n\n\nTwo new commands let you show AI exactly what you're looking at. **Send Element to AI** lets you hover over anything on your screen, like a paragraph, an image or a button, and click to send it to AI Chat. To share a whole window instead, use **Send Window to AI**.\n\n\n**Tip:** Assign a hotkey like `⌘ + ⇧ + 0` to Send Element to AI to grab context even faster.\n\n\n## ✨ New\n\n- **Custom AI Providers**: You can now give custom provider models Raycast's Web Search, Read Page, Search Images and Chart tools. [Turn them on](https://manual.raycast.com/ai/custom-providers#tools) with a `tools` block in `providers.yaml`, and choose whether each one runs on Raycast, your company gateway, or a vendor you have a key for (Tavily, Exa, Firecrawl, Brave, Perplexity or Jina)\n- **Script Commands**: Added controls to enable or disable background refresh for individual scripts\n\n## 💎 Improvements\n\n- **AI**: Made AI requests smaller, so local models reply to a simple message much faster than before and simple requests use fewer credits, without sacrificing response quality. Initial context is now 15% smaller for normal queries, and 40% smaller with automatic extension and skill discovery turned off\n- **AI:** Improved Quick Fix performance\n- **AI Skills**: Improved error details to help AI recover when a skill cannot be loaded\n- **AI Chat**: Included archived chats in sidebar search results\n- **AI Chat**: The extensions list in chat settings now shows every extension whose tools the chat uses, including Terminal, Finder and Automations\n- **AI Commands**: AI Commands and automations no longer stop to show a question form. They now include any question in their reply instead\n- **AI Commands**: When **Replace Selection** can't paste the response, the response is kept on your clipboard and in Clipboard History, and a warning tells you it was copied. This also applies to **Translator**\n- **Dictation:** We now show a clearer status when wrapping up sessions and confirm with a success HUD when finishing a session\n- **Dictation:** We improved post-processing to be faster and more reliable\n- **Clipboard History**: Added an option to save Universal Clipboard items from your iPhone or iPad as soon as they arrive. Find it under Clipboard History settings\n- **Extensions**: Added support for pasting files copied from Finder or File Explorer directly into file pickers\n- **File Search**: Improved CPU and memory utilization. It now uses up to 80% less memory at peak and up to 95% less while searching. Searches are also up to 30% faster, depending on the search terms and number of documents\n- **File Search**: Common development environment caches (e.g. `.cargo/global-cache`, `.venv`) are now excluded from indexing\n- **File Search:** Added image dimensions to the details panel\n- **Memory & Performance:** AI Chat, Notes and Settings now each run in their own process, separate from the launcher. A busy AI Chat or a heavy note no longer slows down Root Search, closed windows free their memory after a cooldown period so Raycast uses less while idle, and it's easier to see which part of Raycast is using memory or CPU\n- **Navigation**: Added support for `Page Up` and `Page Down` in lists and grids\n- **Root Search**: Improved ranking to favor complete words and exact title matches while preserving results learned from your previous searches\n- **Root Search**: Prioritized applications when results are otherwise equally relevant\n- **Settings:** AI Model provider sections in the Manage Models settings page now persist their collapsed state\n- **Settings**: Opening a setting or command from elsewhere in Raycast now reliably scrolls to it and highlights it, including when you switch settings pages or select the same item again\n- **Startup**: Raycast now waits for the keychain to become available instead of showing \"Failed to start\". If it waits more than 10 seconds, it tells you what it's waiting for\n\n## 🐞 Fixes\n\n- **Action Panel**: Fixed the action panel sometimes staying stuck open\n- **AI Chat:** Fixed Quick Look when viewing attachments displaying an icon mid-transition\n- **AI Chat**: Long chat titles and the model and reasoning effort labels truncate in the header\n- **AI Chat**: Long model names in the `/` menu truncates, and hovering a model now shows a preview of its details\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed chats created before 2.3.0 reopening with no agent and the default model. They now restore their original agent, model and reasoning effort\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed Reasoning Effort being hidden for agents whose model is set to Inherit\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed `⌘ + Enter` and `⌥ + Enter` not working while the tool-approval input is focused\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed chats that AI had archived, pinned or deleted not updating in the sidebar until Raycast was restarted\n- **Auto Quit**: Fixed apps like Slack being quit during calls on macOS 27\n- **Clipboard History**: Fixed clipboard capture getting stuck when an app stopped responding while its copied content was being read\n- **Dictation**: Fixed an issue where dictation would continue when you locked your machine or put it to sleep\n- **Dictionary**: Allowed text selection in the detail view\n- **Extensions**: Fixed manually running a command re-enabling background refresh after it had been disabled\n- **Extensions**: Allowed text selection in list detail panels\n- **Feedback**: Allowed Escape to close the window, respecting the user preference\n- **File Search**: Brought back the Raycast v1 shortcut `⌘ + I` for **Show Info in Finder**\n- **File Search:** Content search using Spotlight should now be faster and return the intended results\n- **Focus**: Fixed apps blocked by a Focus session reopening before you acknowledged that the session ended. They're now restored when you dismiss the completion prompt, even after a restart\n- **Hotkeys**: Fixed text typed right after opening Raycast with a hotkey being swallowed for a few seconds and then lost\n- **Hotkey Recorder**: Fixed flickering when deleting a hotkey with Backspace\n- **Launcher**: Fixed the global hotkey reopening the last command instead of Root Search, and the window not closing or returning to root after a command was opened by hotkey during startup\n- **Notes**: Improved performance when opening notes with deeply nested lists\n- **Notes**: Made sure notes you create now keep working after future updates\n- **Notes**: Fixed code blocks being dropped when AI created or edited a note\n- **Notes**: Fixed note titles of AI created notes not updating after first line edit\n- **MCP**: Fixed edits to running servers reverting to their previous configuration\n- **Memory Usage:** Fixed various memory leaks that could contribute to RAM usage growing\n- **Open Camera**: Fixed the camera preview closing when Raycast loses focus, for example while changing Video Effects in Control Center. It now stays on screen until you close it\n- **Quick AI**: Fixed new chats using the default model from the model list instead of the **Quick AI** default model set in Settings\n- **Quicklinks**: Preserved favicons when “Open With” is a browser\n- **Root Search**: Localized application names should now correctly be searchable\n- **Root Search**: Prevented Quicklink arguments retaining focus after execution\n- **Settings**: Fixed the selection highlight being too faint for disabled commands\n- **Settings**: Fixed a crash when changing the interface size while the main window was hidden\n- **Settings**: Fixed command rows expanding and highlighting again after you'd already navigated to them\n- **Updater:** Fixed an issue where querying the updater's Login Items status could freeze Raycast.":"![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/bbfd0269e25f7a8909adb58e809fc732e977d0a75c6a467681fbd18bcf1a1621.png)\n\n我们进一步优化了内存占用与性能。AI 对话、笔记和设置现在各自在独立进程中运行，繁忙的对话或复杂的笔记不再拖慢主搜索，关闭后也会释放内存。启动器空闲时的内存占用最多降低 35%。文件搜索的峰值内存占用最多降低 80%，搜索期间最多降低 95%，搜索速度最多提升 30%，后台索引的 CPU 占用也显著减少。更多详情见下文。\n\n## 💬 向 AI 发送上下文\n\n两个新命令让你可以将正在查看的内容直接交给 AI。**将元素发送到 AI**：将指针移到屏幕上的段落、图片或按钮等元素上，点击即可发送到 AI 对话。若要分享整个窗口，请使用**将窗口发送到 AI**。\n\n**提示：**为“将元素发送到 AI”设置快捷键，例如 `⌘ + ⇧ + 0`，便能更快地获取上下文。\n\n## ✨ 新功能\n\n- **自定义 AI 模型服务商**：现在可为自定义模型服务商的模型启用 Raycast 的网页搜索、读取网页、搜索图片和图表工具。在 `providers.yaml` 中添加 `tools` 配置块即可[启用这些工具](https://manual.raycast.com/ai/custom-providers#tools)，并可为每个工具选择使用 Raycast、公司网关，或你拥有密钥的服务商（Tavily、Exa、Firecrawl、Brave、Perplexity 或 Jina）。\n- **脚本命令**：新增单独启用或禁用各脚本后台刷新的控制选项。\n\n## 💎 改进\n\n- **AI**：缩小了 AI 请求，在保持回复质量的同时，让本地模型更快地回复简单消息，并减少简单请求消耗的积分。常规查询的初始上下文缩小了 15%；关闭自动发现扩展和技能后，缩小了 40%。\n- **AI**：提升了快速修正的性能。\n- **AI 技能**：完善了错误详情，帮助 AI 在无法加载技能时恢复。\n- **AI 对话**：侧边栏搜索结果现在包含已归档的对话。\n- **AI 对话**：对话设置中的扩展列表现在会显示对话所用工具对应的全部扩展，包括终端、访达和自动化。\n- **AI 命令**：AI 命令和自动化不再暂停并显示提问表单，需要询问的问题会直接包含在回复中。\n- **AI 命令**：当**替换所选内容**无法粘贴回复时，回复会保留在剪贴板和剪贴板历史中，并显示警告，告知回复已复制。此改进同样适用于**翻译器**。\n- **听写**：结束会话时的状态提示更清晰，完成后会显示成功提示。\n- **听写**：后处理速度更快，也更可靠。\n- **剪贴板历史**：新增选项，可在收到 iPhone 或 iPad 的通用剪贴板内容后立即保存，可在剪贴板历史设置中开启。\n- **扩展**：支持将从访达或文件资源管理器复制的文件直接粘贴到文件选择器中。\n- **文件搜索**：优化了 CPU 和内存使用。峰值内存占用最多降低 80%，搜索期间最多降低 95%；根据搜索词和文档数量的不同，搜索速度最多提升 30%。\n- **文件搜索**：索引现在会排除常见的开发环境缓存，例如 `.cargo/global-cache` 和 `.venv`。\n- **文件搜索**：详情面板新增图片尺寸信息。\n- **内存与性能**：AI 对话、笔记和设置现在各自在独立于启动器的进程中运行。繁忙的 AI 对话或复杂笔记不再拖慢主搜索；关闭窗口后，经过短暂等待便会释放其内存，降低 Raycast 空闲时的占用；也更容易辨认各部分的内存和 CPU 使用情况。\n- **导航**：列表和网格支持使用 `Page Up` 和 `Page Down` 翻页。\n- **主搜索**：优化排序，优先匹配完整单词和精确标题，同时保留从以往搜索中学习到的结果偏好。\n- **主搜索**：当结果的相关性相同时，优先显示应用。\n- **设置**：“管理模型”页面现在会记住各 AI 模型服务商分区的折叠状态。\n- **设置**：从 Raycast 其他位置打开设置项或命令时，现在能可靠地滚动到对应位置并高亮显示，包括切换设置页面或再次选择同一项的情况。\n- **启动**：Raycast 现在会等待钥匙串可用，不再直接显示“启动失败”。若等待超过 10 秒，会说明正在等待什么。\n\n## 🐞 修复\n\n- **操作面板**：修复操作面板有时卡在打开状态的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复使用快速查看浏览附件时，过渡动画中途显示图标的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：标题栏中过长的对话标题、模型名称和推理强度标签现在会截断显示。\n- **AI 对话**：`/` 菜单中过长的模型名称现在会截断显示，悬停在模型上可预览其详情。\n- **AI 对话**：修复 2.3.0 之前创建的对话重新打开后丢失智能体并使用默认模型的问题，现在会恢复原来的智能体、模型和推理强度。\n- **AI 对话**：修复模型设为“继承”的智能体不显示推理强度的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复工具批准输入框获得焦点时，`⌘ + Enter` 和 `⌥ + Enter` 无效的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复 AI 归档、置顶或删除对话后，侧边栏必须重新启动 Raycast 才更新的问题。\n- **自动退出**：修复 macOS 27 上 Slack 等应用在通话期间被退出的问题。\n- **剪贴板历史**：修复读取复制内容时，来源应用停止响应导致剪贴板捕获卡住的问题。\n- **听写**：修复锁定电脑或使其进入睡眠后，听写仍继续运行的问题。\n- **词典**：详情视图中的文本现在可以选中。\n- **扩展**：修复禁用后台刷新后，手动运行命令会再次启用后台刷新的问题。\n- **扩展**：列表详情面板中的文本现在可以选中。\n- **反馈**：支持按 Escape 关闭窗口，并遵循用户的偏好设置。\n- **文件搜索**：恢复 Raycast v1 中用于**在访达中显示简介**的快捷键 `⌘ + I`。\n- **文件搜索**：使用 Spotlight 搜索文件内容时，现在速度更快，结果也更符合预期。\n- **专注**：修复专注会话结束后，尚未确认结束便重新打开被阻止应用的问题。现在仅在关闭完成提示后恢复这些应用，重新启动后也一样。\n- **快捷键**：修复通过快捷键打开 Raycast 后立即输入的文字被吞掉数秒，随后丢失的问题。\n- **快捷键录入**：修复使用 Backspace 删除快捷键时的闪烁问题。\n- **启动器**：修复全局快捷键重新打开上一个命令而非主搜索的问题，以及启动期间通过快捷键打开命令后，窗口无法关闭或返回主搜索的问题。\n- **笔记**：提升打开包含深层嵌套列表的笔记时的性能。\n- **笔记**：确保现在创建的笔记在未来更新后仍能正常使用。\n- **笔记**：修复 AI 创建或编辑笔记时丢失代码块的问题。\n- **笔记**：修复编辑首行后，AI 创建的笔记标题未更新的问题。\n- **MCP**：修复对正在运行的服务器所作的修改被还原为旧配置的问题。\n- **内存使用**：修复多处可能导致内存占用持续增长的内存泄漏。\n- **打开相机**：修复 Raycast 失去焦点时相机预览关闭的问题，例如在控制中心调整视频效果时。预览现在会一直保留在屏幕上，直到你手动关闭。\n- **快捷 AI**：修复新对话使用模型列表的默认模型，而非设置中为**快捷 AI**指定的默认模型的问题。\n- **快捷链接**：“打开方式”设为浏览器时，现在会保留网站图标。\n- **主搜索**：现在可以正确搜索应用的本地化名称。\n- **主搜索**：避免快捷链接执行后参数输入框仍保留焦点。\n- **设置**：修复已禁用命令的选中高亮过浅的问题。\n- **设置**：修复主窗口隐藏时更改界面尺寸导致崩溃的问题。\n- **设置**：修复已定位到命令后，对应行再次展开并高亮的问题。\n- **更新程序**：修复查询更新程序的登录项状态可能导致 Raycast 卡死的问题。","⚡ More performance improvements and new ways to send context to AI":"⚡ 更多性能优化与向 AI 发送上下文的新方式","![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/0d0ba49f52facf1b8d8fb55bb957fa8b0e67f7924f5ea47ac73c07a34f732689.png)":"![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/0d0ba49f52facf1b8d8fb55bb957fa8b0e67f7924f5ea47ac73c07a34f732689.png)","This update is about speed. File Search returns results up to 6× faster and handles typos much better, Root Search and other lists scroll smoother than ever, and extensions install and update about 4× faster on average. Raycast also starts with about 20% less memory.":"本次更新着重提升速度。文件搜索返回结果的速度最高提升至原来的 6 倍，对拼写错误的处理也明显改善；主搜索和其他列表滚动更加流畅；扩展安装和更新的速度平均提升至原来的约 4 倍。此外，Raycast 启动时的内存占用降低了约 20%。","- **AI Skills**: Browse installed extension skills in AI settings":"- **AI 技能**：可在 AI 设置中浏览已安装扩展提供的技能。","- **Calendar**: Added support for joining Gong meetings":"- **日历**：新增加入 Gong 会议的支持。","- **Emoji & Symbols**: Added Greek letters":"- **表情与符号**：新增希腊字母。","- **Notes**: Cmd+click on a parent todo now toggles all nested todos":"- **笔记**：按住 Command 点击父级待办事项，现在会同时切换所有嵌套待办事项的完成状态。","- **AI Chat**: Made mention labels clearer by distinguishing skills and MCP tools":"- **AI 对话**：区分技能与 MCP 工具，使提及标签更加清晰。","- **AI Chat**: Reduced the data sent at the start of a chat by loading extension tools more selectively":"- **AI 对话**：更有选择地加载扩展工具，减少开始对话时发送的数据。","- **AI Chat**: Added the New Project keyboard shortcut to button tooltips and made project creation action names consistent":"- **AI 对话**：在按钮提示中显示“新建项目”的快捷键，并统一创建项目相关操作的名称。","- **AI Chat**: Clarified when you’ve reached the weekly Claude Fable usage limit":"- **AI 对话**：更清晰地提示已达到 Claude Fable 每周用量上限。","- **AI Chat**: Images you attach when using local models now stay on your device when Cloud Sync or AI Chat History sync is turned off":"- **AI 对话**：使用本地模型时，如果关闭了云同步或 AI 对话历史同步，附加的图片现在只会保留在设备上。","- **AI Chat**: Added a primary action setting to Send Window and Send Element to AI":"- **AI 对话**：为“将窗口发送到 AI”和“将元素发送到 AI”新增主要操作设置。","- **Clipboard History**: Improved image & file icons":"- **剪贴板历史**：改进图片和文件图标。","- **Custom Providers**: Numeric provider API keys are now kept exactly as written, and authentication failures are explained better when they occur":"- **自定义模型服务商**：数字形式的模型服务商 API 密钥现在会按原样保留，并在身份验证失败时提供更清晰的说明。","- **Dictation:** Settings are now organised better, making it easier to find exactly what you’re looking for":"- **听写**：重新整理设置，让所需选项更容易找到。","- **Extensions**: Installs and updates are about 4× faster on average, and up to 30× faster":"- **扩展**：安装和更新速度平均提升至原来的约 4 倍，最高可达 30 倍。","- **File Search**: Results show up to 6× faster, slow searches are gone, typos are handled much better, and indexing your files is faster and uses less CPU":"- **文件搜索**：结果显示速度最高提升至原来的 6 倍，解决搜索缓慢的问题，更好地处理拼写错误，并提高索引速度、降低 CPU 占用。","- **Lighter at startup**: Raycast uses about 20% less memory at launch and starts faster":"- **启动更轻快**：Raycast 启动时的内存占用降低约 20%，启动速度也更快。","- **Proxy**: Raycast now honors HTTP_PROXY, HTTPS_PROXY and NO_PROXY for all its traffic.":"- **代理**：Raycast 的所有网络流量现在均遵循 HTTP_PROXY、HTTPS_PROXY 和 NO_PROXY 设置。","- **Smoother scrolling**: Root Search and other lists scroll up to 2× faster":"- **滚动更流畅**：主搜索和其他列表的滚动速度最高提升至原来的 2 倍。","- **Updater:** Avoid automatic installation while Dictation or AIAgents are active in the background":"- **更新程序**：听写或 AI 智能体在后台活动时，避免自动安装更新。","- **Updater:** Detect an update installed from another user account on the same Mac":"- **更新程序**：可检测同一台 Mac 上其他用户账户安装的更新。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed the window freezing during streaming of very long lists":"- **AI 对话**：修复流式输出很长的列表时窗口卡住的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed pasting into the composer not working when it isn’t focused":"- **AI 对话**：修复输入框未获得焦点时无法粘贴的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed new chats sending the wrong model when the saved model is unavailable":"- **AI 对话**：修复保存的模型不可用时，新对话请求使用错误模型的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed image generation being unavailable with Ollama and extension models":"- **AI 对话**：修复使用 Ollama 和扩展模型时无法生成图片的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed Claude subscription models compacting too early":"- **AI 对话**：修复 Claude 订阅模型过早压缩上下文的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed missing skill names when restoring chat history":"- **AI 对话**：修复恢复对话历史时技能名称缺失的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed sidebar actions not responding while peeking at the sidebar":"- **AI 对话**：修复临时展开侧边栏时操作无响应的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed archived chats also appearing in their project’s sidebar section":"- **AI 对话**：修复已归档的对话仍出现在项目侧边栏分区中的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Removed a misplaced loading indicator from the sidebar":"- **AI 对话**：移除侧边栏中位置不正确的加载指示器。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed pressing Return not sending messages containing paths starting with `/`":"- **AI 对话**：修复消息包含以 `/` 开头的路径时，按 Return 无法发送的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Show a subscription prompt when sending a message while signed out, instead of showing a send error":"- **AI 对话**：未登录时发送消息现在会显示订阅提示，而非发送错误。","- **AI Chat**: Fixed `⌘ + ↑` and `⌘ + ↓` moving between messages before reaching the start or end of the composer text":"- **AI 对话**：修复输入光标尚未到达文本开头或末尾时，`⌘ + ↑` 和 `⌘ + ↓` 就在消息之间切换的问题。","- **AI Chat**: Agents you turn off in Settings no longer appear in the composer":"- **AI 对话**：在设置中关闭的智能体不再出现在输入框中。","- **Automations**: Fixed automations created in a project starting chats outside that project, and added project destinations to the automation settings":"- **自动化**：修复项目内创建的自动化在项目外启动对话的问题，并在自动化设置中增加项目目标位置。","- **Claude**: Fixed subscription status remaining outdated after signing in and valid subscription accounts being incorrectly rejected":"- **Claude**：修复登录后订阅状态未更新，以及有效订阅账户被错误拒绝的问题。","- **Extensions**: Fixed unnecessary scroll jumps while navigating lists and grids":"- **扩展**：修复导航列表和网格时不必要的滚动跳动。","- **Extensions**: Fixed ghost hotkeys for removed extension commands":"- **扩展**：修复已移除扩展命令的残留快捷键。","- **File Search**: Fixed the “Indexing Files…” row sometimes spinning forever after launch":"- **文件搜索**：修复启动后“正在索引文件…”有时一直显示加载动画的问题。","- **File Index**: Fixed changes made while Raycast was closed sometimes not being picked up on launch":"- **文件索引**：修复 Raycast 关闭期间发生的更改有时无法在启动时识别的问题。","- **File Index**: Fixed deleted or excluded files sometimes still showing up in results after a reboot":"- **文件索引**：修复重新启动后已删除或已排除的文件有时仍出现在搜索结果中的问题。","- **Quick AI**: Fixed an issue where the action bar would sometimes appear too high in authentication views":"- **快捷 AI**：修复身份验证视图中操作栏有时位置过高的问题。","- **Root Search**: Fixed an issue affecting compact mode users where alias would sometimes not activate after pressing space":"- **主搜索**：修复紧凑模式下按空格有时无法激活别名的问题。","- **Script Commands**: Fixed optional argument prompts being skipped when launching from a hotkey":"- **脚本命令**：修复通过快捷键启动时跳过可选参数提示的问题。","- **Script Commands**: Fixed inline scripts showing stale output after an error":"- **脚本命令**：修复内联脚本出错后仍显示旧输出的问题。","- **Settings**: Fixed signed-in accounts without a display name incorrectly showing “Not Signed In”":"- **设置**：修复已登录但没有显示名称的账户被错误显示为“未登录”的问题。","- **Translator**: Fixed an issue where swapping language when the translation is loading would clear the input":"- **翻译器**：修复翻译加载期间交换语言会清空输入的问题。","- **UI**: Fixed an issue in the toast action panel where too much space was left below the description when no actions are present":"- **界面**：修复没有操作项时，通知操作面板的描述下方留白过多的问题。","- **Window Management**: Ignored hotkeys for missing layouts and custom commands":"- **窗口管理**：忽略缺失布局和自定义命令对应的快捷键。","- **Menu Bar:** Items that hide themselves stay hidden after a restart.":"- **菜单栏**：自行隐藏的项目在重新启动后仍保持隐藏。","- **Calendar**: Fixed the menu bar item disappearing when an event title was cut off mid-emoji.":"- **日历**：修复事件标题在表情符号中间被截断时，菜单栏项目消失的问题。","- **App Relocation**: Fixed a blurry app icon in relocation alerts":"- **应用移动**：修复应用移动提示中的图标模糊问题。","- **Billing**: Fixed a \"Subtotal\" typo on the billing interval update page":"- **账单**：修复更改账单周期页面上“Subtotal”的拼写错误。","- **Capture Window**: Fixed custom wallpaper accepting non-image files":"- **窗口截屏**：修复自定义壁纸可以选择非图片文件的问题。","- **Clipboard History**: Fixed Paste Sequentially repeating multi-category clipboard entries":"- **剪贴板历史**：修复依次粘贴时重复粘贴属于多个分类的剪贴板项目的问题。","- **General**: Fixed the missing Raycast version in database error alerts":"- **通用**：修复数据库错误提示中缺少 Raycast 版本号的问题。","- **Hyper Key**: Fixed the Secure Input HUD not pointing to the setting that fixes it":"- **超级键**：修复安全输入提示未指向相应解决设置的问题。","- **Menu Bar**: Fixed jumping menu bar extra titles by using monospaced digits":"- **菜单栏**：使用等宽数字，修复菜单栏附加项目标题跳动的问题。","- **Open Camera**: Fixed Open Camera popping back to root while the preview is visible":"- **打开相机**：修复预览仍显示时却返回主搜索的问题。","- **Quick AI**: Fixed the missing Regenerate with Model action":"- **快捷 AI**：修复缺少“使用指定模型重新生成”操作的问题。","- **Quicklinks**: Fixed \"Invalid URL\" being shown when {selection} could not be resolved":"- **快捷链接**：修复无法解析 {selection} 时显示“无效 URL”的问题。","- **Snippets:** Fixed snippets not being expanded in Save File dialogs":"- **文本片段**：修复在保存文件对话框中无法展开文本片段的问题。","- **Updater:** Raycast now relaunches itself if an update or restart fails after the app was already closed":"- **更新程序**：应用关闭后若更新或重新启动失败，Raycast 现在会自行重新启动。","- **Window Management:** Fixed \"Switch to Previous/Next Space\" without animation flickering or not working in macOS 27":"- **窗口管理**：修复 macOS 27 中无动画切换上一个或下一个空间时闪烁或无效的问题。","![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/0d0ba49f52facf1b8d8fb55bb957fa8b0e67f7924f5ea47ac73c07a34f732689.png)\n\n\nThis update is about speed. File Search returns results up to 6× faster and handles typos much better, Root Search and other lists scroll smoother than ever, and extensions install and update about 4× faster on average. Raycast also starts with about 20% less memory.\n\n\n## ✨ New\n\n- **AI Skills**: Browse installed extension skills in AI settings\n- **Calendar**: Added support for joining Gong meetings\n- **Emoji & Symbols**: Added Greek letters\n- **Notes**: Cmd+click on a parent todo now toggles all nested todos\n\n## 💎 Improvements\n\n- **AI Chat**: Made mention labels clearer by distinguishing skills and MCP tools\n- **AI Chat**: Reduced the data sent at the start of a chat by loading extension tools more selectively\n- **AI Chat**: Added the New Project keyboard shortcut to button tooltips and made project creation action names consistent\n- **AI Chat**: Clarified when you’ve reached the weekly Claude Fable usage limit\n- **AI Chat**: Images you attach when using local models now stay on your device when Cloud Sync or AI Chat History sync is turned off\n- **AI Chat**: Added a primary action setting to Send Window and Send Element to AI\n- **Clipboard History**: Improved image & file icons\n- **Custom Providers**: Numeric provider API keys are now kept exactly as written, and authentication failures are explained better when they occur\n- **Dictation:** Settings are now organised better, making it easier to find exactly what you’re looking for\n- **Extensions**: Installs and updates are about 4× faster on average, and up to 30× faster\n- **File Search**: Results show up to 6× faster, slow searches are gone, typos are handled much better, and indexing your files is faster and uses less CPU\n- **Lighter at startup**: Raycast uses about 20% less memory at launch and starts faster\n- **Proxy**: Raycast now honors HTTP_PROXY, HTTPS_PROXY and NO_PROXY for all its traffic.\n- **Smoother scrolling**: Root Search and other lists scroll up to 2× faster\n- **Updater:** Avoid automatic installation while Dictation or AIAgents are active in the background\n- **Updater:** Detect an update installed from another user account on the same Mac\n\n## 🐞 Fixes\n\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed the window freezing during streaming of very long lists\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed pasting into the composer not working when it isn’t focused\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed new chats sending the wrong model when the saved model is unavailable\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed image generation being unavailable with Ollama and extension models\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed Claude subscription models compacting too early\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed missing skill names when restoring chat history\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed sidebar actions not responding while peeking at the sidebar\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed archived chats also appearing in their project’s sidebar section\n- **AI Chat**: Removed a misplaced loading indicator from the sidebar\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed pressing Return not sending messages containing paths starting with `/`\n- **AI Chat**: Show a subscription prompt when sending a message while signed out, instead of showing a send error\n- **AI Chat**: Fixed `⌘ + ↑` and `⌘ + ↓` moving between messages before reaching the start or end of the composer text\n- **AI Chat**: Agents you turn off in Settings no longer appear in the composer\n- **Automations**: Fixed automations created in a project starting chats outside that project, and added project destinations to the automation settings\n- **Claude**: Fixed subscription status remaining outdated after signing in and valid subscription accounts being incorrectly rejected\n- **Extensions**: Fixed unnecessary scroll jumps while navigating lists and grids\n- **Extensions**: Fixed ghost hotkeys for removed extension commands\n- **File Search**: Fixed the “Indexing Files…” row sometimes spinning forever after launch\n- **File Index**: Fixed changes made while Raycast was closed sometimes not being picked up on launch\n- **File Index**: Fixed deleted or excluded files sometimes still showing up in results after a reboot\n- **Quick AI**: Fixed an issue where the action bar would sometimes appear too high in authentication views\n- **Root Search**: Fixed an issue affecting compact mode users where alias would sometimes not activate after pressing space\n- **Script Commands**: Fixed optional argument prompts being skipped when launching from a hotkey\n- **Script Commands**: Fixed inline scripts showing stale output after an error\n- **Settings**: Fixed signed-in accounts without a display name incorrectly showing “Not Signed In”\n- **Translator**: Fixed an issue where swapping language when the translation is loading would clear the input\n- **UI**: Fixed an issue in the toast action panel where too much space was left below the description when no actions are present\n- **Window Management**: Ignored hotkeys for missing layouts and custom commands\n- **Menu Bar:** Items that hide themselves stay hidden after a restart.\n- **Calendar**: Fixed the menu bar item disappearing when an event title was cut off mid-emoji.\n- **App Relocation**: Fixed a blurry app icon in relocation alerts\n- **Billing**: Fixed a \"Subtotal\" typo on the billing interval update page\n- **Capture Window**: Fixed custom wallpaper accepting non-image files\n- **Clipboard History**: Fixed Paste Sequentially repeating multi-category clipboard entries\n- **General**: Fixed the missing Raycast version in database error alerts\n- **Hyper Key**: Fixed the Secure Input HUD not pointing to the setting that fixes it\n- **Menu Bar**: Fixed jumping menu bar extra titles by using monospaced digits\n- **Open Camera**: Fixed Open Camera popping back to root while the preview is visible\n- **Quick AI**: Fixed the missing Regenerate with Model action\n- **Quicklinks**: Fixed \"Invalid URL\" being shown when {selection} could not be resolved\n- **Snippets:** Fixed snippets not being expanded in Save File dialogs\n- **Updater:** Raycast now relaunches itself if an update or restart fails after the app was already closed\n- **Window Management:** Fixed \"Switch to Previous/Next Space\" without animation flickering or not working in macOS 27":"![image](https://misc-assets.raycast.com/releases/0d0ba49f52facf1b8d8fb55bb957fa8b0e67f7924f5ea47ac73c07a34f732689.png)\n\n本次更新着重提升速度。文件搜索返回结果的速度最高提升至原来的 6 倍，对拼写错误的处理也明显改善；主搜索和其他列表滚动更加流畅；扩展安装和更新的速度平均提升至原来的约 4 倍。此外，Raycast 启动时的内存占用降低了约 20%。\n\n## ✨ 新功能\n\n- **AI 技能**：可在 AI 设置中浏览已安装扩展提供的技能。\n- **日历**：新增加入 Gong 会议的支持。\n- **表情与符号**：新增希腊字母。\n- **笔记**：按住 Command 点击父级待办事项，现在会同时切换所有嵌套待办事项的完成状态。\n\n## 💎 改进\n\n- **AI 对话**：区分技能与 MCP 工具，使提及标签更加清晰。\n- **AI 对话**：更有选择地加载扩展工具，减少开始对话时发送的数据。\n- **AI 对话**：在按钮提示中显示“新建项目”的快捷键，并统一创建项目相关操作的名称。\n- **AI 对话**：更清晰地提示已达到 Claude Fable 每周用量上限。\n- **AI 对话**：使用本地模型时，如果关闭了云同步或 AI 对话历史同步，附加的图片现在只会保留在设备上。\n- **AI 对话**：为“将窗口发送到 AI”和“将元素发送到 AI”新增主要操作设置。\n- **剪贴板历史**：改进图片和文件图标。\n- **自定义模型服务商**：数字形式的模型服务商 API 密钥现在会按原样保留，并在身份验证失败时提供更清晰的说明。\n- **听写**：重新整理设置，让所需选项更容易找到。\n- **扩展**：安装和更新速度平均提升至原来的约 4 倍，最高可达 30 倍。\n- **文件搜索**：结果显示速度最高提升至原来的 6 倍，解决搜索缓慢的问题，更好地处理拼写错误，并提高索引速度、降低 CPU 占用。\n- **启动更轻快**：Raycast 启动时的内存占用降低约 20%，启动速度也更快。\n- **代理**：Raycast 的所有网络流量现在均遵循 HTTP_PROXY、HTTPS_PROXY 和 NO_PROXY 设置。\n- **滚动更流畅**：主搜索和其他列表的滚动速度最高提升至原来的 2 倍。\n- **更新程序**：听写或 AI 智能体在后台活动时，避免自动安装更新。\n- **更新程序**：可检测同一台 Mac 上其他用户账户安装的更新。\n\n## 🐞 修复\n\n- **AI 对话**：修复流式输出很长的列表时窗口卡住的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复输入框未获得焦点时无法粘贴的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复保存的模型不可用时，新对话请求使用错误模型的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复使用 Ollama 和扩展模型时无法生成图片的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复 Claude 订阅模型过早压缩上下文的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复恢复对话历史时技能名称缺失的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复临时展开侧边栏时操作无响应的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：修复已归档的对话仍出现在项目侧边栏分区中的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：移除侧边栏中位置不正确的加载指示器。\n- **AI 对话**：修复消息包含以 `/` 开头的路径时，按 Return 无法发送的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：未登录时发送消息现在会显示订阅提示，而非发送错误。\n- **AI 对话**：修复输入光标尚未到达文本开头或末尾时，`⌘ + ↑` 和 `⌘ + ↓` 就在消息之间切换的问题。\n- **AI 对话**：在设置中关闭的智能体不再出现在输入框中。\n- **自动化**：修复项目内创建的自动化在项目外启动对话的问题，并在自动化设置中增加项目目标位置。\n- **Claude**：修复登录后订阅状态未更新，以及有效订阅账户被错误拒绝的问题。\n- **扩展**：修复导航列表和网格时不必要的滚动跳动。\n- **扩展**：修复已移除扩展命令的残留快捷键。\n- **文件搜索**：修复启动后“正在索引文件…”有时一直显示加载动画的问题。\n- **文件索引**：修复 Raycast 关闭期间发生的更改有时无法在启动时识别的问题。\n- **文件索引**：修复重新启动后已删除或已排除的文件有时仍出现在搜索结果中的问题。\n- **快捷 AI**：修复身份验证视图中操作栏有时位置过高的问题。\n- **主搜索**：修复紧凑模式下按空格有时无法激活别名的问题。\n- **脚本命令**：修复通过快捷键启动时跳过可选参数提示的问题。\n- **脚本命令**：修复内联脚本出错后仍显示旧输出的问题。\n- **设置**：修复已登录但没有显示名称的账户被错误显示为“未登录”的问题。\n- **翻译器**：修复翻译加载期间交换语言会清空输入的问题。\n- **界面**：修复没有操作项时，通知操作面板的描述下方留白过多的问题。\n- **窗口管理**：忽略缺失布局和自定义命令对应的快捷键。\n- **菜单栏**：自行隐藏的项目在重新启动后仍保持隐藏。\n- **日历**：修复事件标题在表情符号中间被截断时，菜单栏项目消失的问题。\n- **应用移动**：修复应用移动提示中的图标模糊问题。\n- **账单**：修复更改账单周期页面上“Subtotal”的拼写错误。\n- **窗口截屏**：修复自定义壁纸可以选择非图片文件的问题。\n- **剪贴板历史**：修复依次粘贴时重复粘贴属于多个分类的剪贴板项目的问题。\n- **通用**：修复数据库错误提示中缺少 Raycast 版本号的问题。\n- **超级键**：修复安全输入提示未指向相应解决设置的问题。\n- **菜单栏**：使用等宽数字，修复菜单栏附加项目标题跳动的问题。\n- **打开相机**：修复预览仍显示时却返回主搜索的问题。\n- **快捷 AI**：修复缺少“使用指定模型重新生成”操作的问题。\n- **快捷链接**：修复无法解析 {selection} 时显示“无效 URL”的问题。\n- **文本片段**：修复在保存文件对话框中无法展开文本片段的问题。\n- **更新程序**：应用关闭后若更新或重新启动失败，Raycast 现在会自行重新启动。\n- **窗口管理**：修复 macOS 27 中无动画切换上一个或下一个空间时闪烁或无效的问题。","⚡ Performance Improvements":"⚡ 性能改进"};if(Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(map,value))return map[value];if(/^What's new in v[\d.]+\?$/.test(value))return value.replace(/^What's new in v([\d.]+)\?$/, "v$1 更新内容");return value.split("\n").map(line=>Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(map,line)?map[line]:line).join("\n")}
